                    <h3>Hostel &amp; Fees Rush-Hour Queue</h3>
                    <p>More students are signing in than the server can hash at once. You are held in an orderly Redis queue instead of timing out.</p>
                  </div>

                  <div class="cg-queue-metrics">
                    <div class="cg-qbox">
                      <span class="cg-qlabel">Your Queue Position</span>
                      <strong class="cg-qval" id="q-pos">#42</strong>
                      <span class="cg-qsub">of <span id="q-total">1,850</span> arriving</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cg-qbox">
                      <span class="cg-qlabel">Estimated Wait</span>
                      <strong class="cg-qval" id="q-wait">~15s</strong>
                      <span class="cg-qsub">Batch: 50 every 5s</span>
