                    <span class="cg-chip cg-chip-slate">Layer 2 &amp; 3 · Bcrypt Cost-10 + Fair Lockout</span>
                    <h3>Sign in to CampusGate</h3>
                    <p>Every failure path executes exactly 1 bcrypt check (~142 ms) and returns a byte-identical HTTP 401 message.</p>
                  </div>

                  <div class="cg-mock-form">
                    <div class="cg-field-row">
                      <label>Matric Number / Email</label>
                      <input type="text" id="sim-matric" value="SCI/2025/0061" readonly>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cg-field-row">
                      <label>Password Check Simulator</label>
                      <div class="cg-sim-btn-group">
                        <button type="button" class="cg-sim-btn" data-login-action="wrong">
                          Wrong Password (+1 Fail)
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="cg-sim-btn" data-login-action="unknown">
                          Unknown Matric (Dummy Hash)
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="cg-sim-btn cg-sim-btn-warn" data-login-action="timeout">
                          Server HTTP 503 (+0 Fail)
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="cg-sim-btn cg-sim-btn-ok" data-login-action="correct">
                          Correct Password ✓
                        </button>
                      </div>
                    </div>

