                      </div>
                      <p class="cg-fb-msg" id="fb-msg">
                        Click a button above to test atomic failure counting, dummy-hash anti-enumeration, or FR-P5 timeout fairness.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- VIEW 3: SECOND FACTOR (EMAIL OTP / TOTP) -->
                <div class="cg-view" id="view-mfa">
                  <div class="cg-view-header">
                    <span class="cg-chip cg-chip-emerald">Layer 4 · Pre-Auth Ticket (256-bit HttpOnly)</span>
                    <h3>Two-Step Verification</h3>
                    <p>Password failure counter is only reset after the second factor succeeds. Codes are stored hashed with HMAC-SHA256.</p>
                  </div>

                  <div class="cg-mfa-box">
                    <div class="cg-mfa-methods">
                      <div class="cg-mfa-card active" id="mfa-card-otp">
                        <strong>Email One-Time Code</strong>
                        <span>6 digits · 5-min TTL · Max 3 atomic attempts</span>
                        <code>HMAC-SHA256(key, "otp:" + uid + ":" + code)</code>
                      </div>
                      <div class="cg-mfa-card" id="mfa-card-totp">
                        <strong>Authenticator App (TOTP)</strong>
                        <span>RFC 6238 · ±1 step drift · Replay blocked</span>
                        <code>AES-256-GCM encrypted secret + 8 backup codes</code>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="cg-otp-digits" aria-label="Sample 6 digit code">
                      <span>4</span><span>8</span><span>2</span><span>9</span><span>1</span><span>6</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="cg-view-footer">
                      <button type="button" class="cg-canvas-btn" id="btn-verify-mfa">
                        Verify Code &amp; Issue Signed JWT →
                      </button>
                      <a href="/verify" class="cg-inline-link">Open real /verify page</a>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- VIEW 4: LOGIN-ONCE PORTAL SERVICES -->
                <div class="cg-view" id="view-portal">
                  <div class="cg-view-header">
                    <span class="cg-chip cg-chip-emerald">Layer 5 · Login-Once JWT Session (0 DB Queries)</span>
                    <h3>UNN Student Portal Services</h3>
                    <p>Each service verifies the signed JWT cookie, checks Redis <code>jti</code> revocation, and reads in-memory RBAC permissions without hitting PostgreSQL.</p>
                  </div>

                  <div class="cg-portal-grid">
                    <a href="/portal/fees" class="cg-pservice-card">
                      <div class="cg-pservice-top">
                        <strong>School Fees Payment</strong>
                        <span class="cg-pbadge">0 DB Queries</span>
                      </div>
                      <p>Verify session via JWT + step-up OTP confirmation before mock payment execution.</p>
                      <span class="cg-plink">Open /portal/fees →</span>
                    </a>

                    <a href="/portal/hostel" class="cg-pservice-card">
                      <div class="cg-pservice-top">
                        <strong>Hostel Allocation</strong>
                        <span class="cg-pbadge">0 DB Queries</span>
                      </div>
                      <p>Protected by faculty/level access windows and login-once token verification.</p>
                      <span class="cg-plink">Open /portal/hostel →</span>
                    </a>

                    <a href="/portal/registration" class="cg-pservice-card">
                      <div class="cg-pservice-top">
                        <strong>Course Registration</strong>
                        <span class="cg-pbadge">0 DB Queries</span>
                      </div>
                      <p>Instant course registration access with immediate Redis token revocation on logout.</p>
                      <span class="cg-plink">Open /portal/registration →</span>
                    </a>
